id: marked-minion
name: Marked Minion
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 99
# Not a Combat Condition: Minion Mark (1)'s - its (bT), the Master's base Tier, as stacks. 4 Life Points a stack at the start of each Combat
# Round (combat.mjs markedMinionsBleed); gone as the Combat Encounter ends.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Marked Minion: Combat Rolls higher by a point a stack; 4 Life Points a stack lost as each Combat Round starts.
text: >
  Minion Mark (1): A Marked Minion loses 4(bT) Life Points at the start of each Combat Round, but their Combat Rolls are increased by 1(bT) – both use your Tier of Power for calculation.

---

[passive per stack]
combatRolls += 1;
